2. motor
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Source:  https://github.com/whynotmake-it/rivership/tree/main/packages/motor
Version: 1.1.0

The spring animation utilities in lib/utils/glass_spring.dart are derived from
the motor package by Tim Lehmann for whynotmake.it. The adapted code implements
an equivalent subset of motor's spring presets (CupertinoMotion) and controller
types (SingleMotionController, SingleMotionBuilder, VelocityMotionBuilder) using
Flutter's built-in physics primitives.

